-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c13-t4-l-q12\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>Anyone has the chance to drive a team of dogs.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c13-t4-l-q12\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>One group member will be chosen to lead the trail.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">13</strong><span>What does Annie say about the team relay event?</span></span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c13-t4-l-q13\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>All participants receive a medal.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c13-t4-l-q13\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>The course is 4 km long.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c13-t4-l-q13\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>Each team is led by a teacher.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">14</strong><span>On the snow-shoe trip, the visitors will</span></span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c13-t4-l-q14\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>visit an old gold mine.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c13-t4-l-q14\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>learn about unusual flowers.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c13-t4-l-q14\" dat